n.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-08T22:46:05-07:00","id":928601,"title":"","content":"Hmm... and what about if the Merge was more between fellow mortals, not the demon?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-09T08:54:32-07:00","id":928750,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrParaduo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=928601#post928601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm... and what about if the Merge was more between fellow mortals, not the demon?</div> </div> </div> </div>What, like making a Vohzd?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-09T09:15:27-07:00","id":928757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=928750#post928750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What, like making a Vohzd?</div> </div> </div> </div>Precisely. Even if only temporary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T07:35:19-07:00","id":942706,"title":"","content":"<b>Vampiric Claws (Form Lambda, <u>Claws</u> + <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/837712-homebrew-embeds-and-exploits?p=849249#post849249\">Finders, Keepers</a>)</b>: These serrated Demonic claws can harvest the life lost by victims to restore the user. For each 2 Lethal damage inflicted, the Demon recovers 1 Lethal damage, or 2 Bashing damage (Lethal is restored first).<br /> <br /> <b>Hellstorm System (Form Lambda, <u>Rain of Fire</u> + <u>Rain of Blood</u> + <u>Hellfire</u>)</b>: When a Demon needs to wipe a location off the map, they can cause cascades of fire to rain from the sky and burn even stone and steel away. Treat this as Rain of Fire, but it covers the area of Rain of Blood, and deals Aggravated damage to targets and objects in the area.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T11:35:54-07:00","id":942842,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=942706#post942706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Vampiric Claws (Form Lambda, <u>Claws</u> + <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/837712-homebrew-embeds-and-exploits?p=849249#post849249&amp;quot;]Finders</a>, Keepers[/URL])</b>: These serrated Demonic claws can harvest the life lost by victims to restore the user. For each 2 Lethal damage inflicted, the Demon recovers 1 Lethal damage, or 2 Bashing damage (Lethal is restored first).<br /> <br /> <b>Hellstorm System (Form Lambda, <u>Rain of Fire</u> + <u>Rain of Blood</u> + <u>Hellfire</u>)</b>: When a Demon needs to wipe a location off the map, they can cause cascades of fire to rain from the sky and burn even stone and steel away. Treat this as Rain of Fire, but it covers the area of Rain of Blood, and deals Aggravated damage to targets and objects in the area.</div> </div> </div> </div>Love these. Would you follow the same rules as form gadgets with these or would you add complications due to their obvious increase in power? Sorry if you addressed that already.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","name":"lladas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T12:46:04-07:00","id":942928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lladas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=942842#post942842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Love these. Would you follow the same rules as form gadgets with these or would you add complications due to their obvious increase in power? Sorry if you addressed that already.</div> </div> </div> </div>As far as the Form component, I usually don't restrict its power or options due to the inherent limitations of Form Gadgets anyways (soul burnout for mortals, integration limits for demons). I'll apply restrictions on any Embeds or Exploits, though (<u>Finders, Keepers</u> in the Vampiric Claws, for instance, only steals Health).<br /> <br /> I made a high end Style Merit that lets you integrate Form Lambdas (Lambdas containing Form Abilities) as normal Form Abilities in the Homebrew Demon Merits thread. These are a some examples I was thinking about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T13:00:15-07:00","id":942933,"title":"","content":"<b>Hellbringer Arsenal System (Form Lambda, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/849897-angelic-form-abilities?p=917000#post917000\">Weapon Integration System</a> + <u>Hellfire</u>)</b>: As per the normal Weapon Integration System, but all attacks deal Aggravated damage.<br /> <br /> <b>Aether Vortex (<u><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/837712-homebrew-embeds-and-exploits?p=849249#post849249\">Finders, Keepers</a></u> + <u><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/837712-homebrew-embeds-and-exploits?p=837729#post837729\">Fate Entanglement</a></u>)</b>: Activating this swirling matrix causes a vacuum effect upon supernatural energies. Roll Presence + Primum, for every 2 Aether you spend, everyone else in the area loses 1 Aether, Essence, etc., unless they beat your successes on a resistance roll (Resolve + Supernatural Tolerance, or Resistance + Rank). (Note: This doesn't not work with Finders, Keepers to give you the resources others lose in this way)<br /> <br /> <b>Healing Aura (Form Lambda, <u>Wound Healing</u> + <u>Halo</u>)</b>: You can emit a healing light, restoring 1 Lethal Damage for all subjects you select that are nearby every turn. [Maybe restrict it to one target?]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 08-03-2016, 04:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T13:17:37-07:00","id":942938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=942928#post942928\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As far as the Form component, I usually don't restrict its power or options due to the inherent limitations of Form Gadgets anyways (soul burnout for mortals, integration limits for demons). I'll apply restrictions on any Embeds or Exploits, though (<u>Finders, Keepers</u> in the Vampiric Claws, for instance, only steals Health).<br /> <br /> I made a high end Style Merit that lets you integrate Form Lambdas (Lambdas containing Form Abilities) as normal Form Abilities in the Homebrew Demon Merits thread. These are a some examples I was thinking about.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see and that makes sense. Thanks for putting that together. I have some ideas for lambda form gadgets I'll por after work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","name":"lladas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-04T19:04:38-07:00","id":944068,"title":"","content":"I love all of these. I'm glad this thread is still active, since I just had a Gadget concept: something based on Show of Power (and perhaps other component abilities) that allows the Demon to absorb, store, and release supernatural abilities. The problem is, I'm not sure how to go with it. One-use globes that can be smashed to release a stored ability?<br /> <br /> I kind of want to go full meta and have them be dice. Maybe the dice have a power captured from another supernatural being stored in each facet, and can only be used by rolling them? Maybe not something a character would create, but it'd be a cool relic for the characters to find.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-04T21:13:10-07:00","id":944112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=944068#post944068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love all of these. I'm glad this thread is still active, since I just had a Gadget concept: something based on Show of Power (and perhaps other component abilities) that allows the Demon to absorb, store, and release supernatural abilities. The problem is, I'm not sure how to go with it. One-use globes that can be smashed to release a stored ability?<br /> <br /> I kind of want to go full meta and have them be dice. Maybe the dice have a power captured from another supernatural being stored in each facet, and can only be used by rolling them? Maybe not something a character would create, but it'd be a cool relic for the characters to find.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm getting vague ideas about combining the Form Ability Amorphous (let's you swap around other Form Abilities) and Show of Power. I don't know what the ultimate expression would be, but something dynamic and Mega-Man-y is my instinct.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-04T21:25:16-07:00","id":944116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=944068#post944068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love all of these. I'm glad this thread is still active, since I just had a Gadget concept: something based on Show of Power (and perhaps other component abilities) that allows the Demon to absorb, store, and release supernatural abilities. The problem is, I'm not sure how to go with it. One-use globes that can be smashed to release a stored ability?<br /> <br /> I kind of want to go full meta and have them be dice. Maybe the dice have a power captured from another supernatural being stored in each facet, and can only be used by rolling them? Maybe not something a character would create, but it'd be a cool relic for the characters to find.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd think a Lambda of the &quot;Fractal Reality&quot; Embed and the &quot;Show of Power&quot; Exploit would make a good &quot;store a supernatural ability and release it later&quot; as a series of one-shots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-04T22:03:13-07:00","id":944129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xenesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=944116#post944116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'd think a Lambda of the &quot;Fractal Reality&quot; Embed and the &quot;Show of Power&quot; Exploit would make a good &quot;store a supernatural ability and release it later&quot; as a series of one-shots.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe eachone would be tailored to the power being stored? Like a tape recorder that played back a Mage's High Speech to unleash a spell, or an injection that granted a Vampire's Discipline power, or a technological totem to contain a Werewolf's Gift.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-04T22:20:41-07:00","id":944137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=944129#post944129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe eachone would be tailored to the power being stored? Like a tape recorder that played back a Mage's High Speech to unleash a spell, or an injection that granted a Vampire's Discipline power, or a technological totem to contain a Werewolf's Gift.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dig it. Maybe have the initial item being something relatively formless to begin with and forming into a specific shape when you &quot;record&quot; a power?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T10:17:43-07:00","id":944390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xenesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=944137#post944137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I dig it. Maybe have the initial item being something relatively formless to begin with and forming into a specific shape when you &amp;quot;record&amp;quot; a power?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, that's a cool idea. Normally, supernatural coercion powers don't work over cameras or recordings, so you could make an entire other Gadget out of a camera or recording device that can record things like a vampire using Dominate or a Changeling Inciting Bedlam and play them back while retaining their power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T19:23:41-07:00","id":944660,"title":"","content":"I had a few ideas this morning:<br /> <br /> <b>Fell Contract (High of Birth + Freeze Assets)</b> - Retroactively alter a human's fate so that they become destitute or talentless. A completely incomprehensible contract filled with contradictory legalese, which needs to be read on a tablet or something similar. Accepting the terms renders the fate.<br /> <br /> <b>Mighty Megaphone (Vox + Authorised)</b> - Speak with a voice of Authority to a target human (e.g Changeling's Mask of Superiority). A decal-embellished microphone that exudes authority when used to talk to someone specifically.<br /> <br /> <b>Eject Button (Behind the Curtain + Rip The Gates)</b> - Transport to the piece of God-Machine infrastructure you have visited most recently. A small badge worn on the chest (or anywhere else) that when struck with a palm causes the user to disappear in a blue flash of light and materialise at their destination.<br /> <br /> <b>Heavenly Choir (Vox + Voice of the Machine + The Word)</b> - Summon an Angel of the God-Machine. A small, alien looking pan-flute that when played creates a call that intrigues the nearest Angel.<br /> <br /> <b>Little Black Book (Urban Legend + Decoy</b>) - Deploy a Fa\u00e7ade as a decoy from an Urban Legend. A small personal contacts book. Each page has the name of a Fa\u00e7ade on it, ripping it out and throwing it on the ground brings the Fa\u00e7ade to life.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-15T13:43:35-07:00","id":951289,"title":"","content":"<b>Golem Foundry (Animate + Hellhounds)</b>: This large furnace pulses with unnatural light. When an object is placed inside and the furnace is turned on, the object emerges as some kind of material construct-Cryptid.<br /> <br /> <b>Imposter Mask (Ephemeral Cover + The Voting Dead)</b>: This liquid seeming mask lets you assume the exact appearance, voice, and even mannerisms of someone you kill. <sub>Edited with malonkey1's suggestion of Ephemeral Cover.</sub>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 08-16-2016, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T10:33:19-07:00","id":951819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=951289#post951289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Imposter Mask (??? + The Voting Dead)</b>: This liquid seeming mask lets you assume the exact appearance, voice, and even mannerisms of someone you kill.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe Ephemeral Cover?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T13:06:59-07:00","id":951949,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=951819#post951819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe Ephemeral Cover?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Perhaps if it was for ephemerals? Or do you mean leveraging the &quot;Rip Corpus off to make a disguise&quot; part?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T13:24:49-07:00","id":951967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=951949#post951949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Perhaps if it was for ephemerals? Or do you mean leveraging the &amp;quot;Rip Corpus off to make a disguise&amp;quot; part?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's more the &quot;kill something and wear its essence as a disguise&quot; mixed with The Voting Dead's ability to add the identity of a dead human to your Cover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-08T13:34:15-07:00","id":965843,"title":"","content":"Not sure if anyone's done this one yet, but how about a booby-trapped gadget that replicates a magic lamp? As in, it imprisons ala Solitary Confinement, then forces the target to bestow a single service on the next user of said-gadget? Not sure what secondary exploit would be needed for that, though.<br /> <br /> Perhaps the object would allow for telepathy with anyone physically touching the object. Or maybe, when activated, a projection of the prisoner is displayed, allowing for communication, but otherwise preventing both prisoner from being harmed or doing harm. That still leads the question on how the victim would go about completing their service though...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-08T13:53:14-07:00","id":965850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrParaduo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=965843#post965843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not sure if anyone's done this one yet, but how about a booby-trapped gadget that replicates a magic lamp? As in, it imprisons ala Solitary Confinement, then forces the target to bestow a single service on the next user of said-gadget? Not sure what secondary exploit would be needed for that, though.<br /> <br /> Perhaps the object would allow for telepathy with anyone physically touching the object. Or maybe, when activated, a projection of the prisoner is displayed, allowing for communication, but otherwise preventing both prisoner from being harmed or doing harm. That still leads the question on how the victim would go about completing their service though...</div> </div> </div> </div>Ultimatum? Do Service (or 3 services) for device user or turn into sand? Could also include a &quot;do no harm or act to prevent user from issuing (3) service request(s)&quot; term to the initial Ultimatum, so as to prevent immediate retaliation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 09-08-2016, 04:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-08T17:20:52-07:00","id":965939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=965850#post965850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ultimatum? Do Service (or 3 services) for device user or turn into sand? Could also include a &quot;do no harm or act to prevent user from issuing (3) service request(s)&quot; term to the initial Ultimatum, so as to prevent immediate retaliation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ultimatum sounds good. But instead of turning to sand, perhaps be sent back into the gadget? Obviously that would be terrible for a mortal, but that's why it'd be great for using on rival demons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-09T21:28:06-07:00","id":966600,"title":"","content":"Another fun Ultimatum Gadget idea: a pen that makes any contract written with it supernaturally binding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T12:52:07-07:00","id":972079,"title":"","content":"Question: what would be the best combination of Embeds/Exploits/Powers for making a USB cord that can download memories and thoughts from a person's mind and digitize them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5