n idea. Since Goetics are a thing, and Demons know about them (since Rip The Gates lets them walk right into the Astral), could you download and incarnate someone's thoughts and memories? Maybe a Lambda with Memory Theft, [something], and Hellhounds?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ohhhhhhhh my god<br /> <br /> Slap those on a pistol, and you've made a fully-functioning Evoker. I love it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T09:31:13-07:00","id":973177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=972268#post972268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm. That give me an idea. Since Goetics are a thing, and Demons know about them (since Rip The Gates lets them walk right into the Astral), could you download and incarnate someone's thoughts and memories? Maybe a Lambda with Memory Theft, [something], and Hellhounds?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm...I wouldn't think you'd need more than Memory Theft and Hellhounds, but maybe Ephemeral Cover?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T10:50:08-07:00","id":973232,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=973177#post973177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hmmm...I wouldn't think you'd need more than Memory Theft and Hellhounds, but maybe Ephemeral Cover?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, maybe you don't. I just feel like there might need to be an intermediary step between &quot;get memories/thoughts&quot; and &quot;make Cryptids&quot;. I could see it working directly as well. &lt;shrug&gt;<br /> <br /> EDIT: If it is only two, a third could add the ever-fun Rain of Blood to incarnate a small towns' worth of thoughts, feelings, and memories. Or you could set up a kind of throne for a Forbidden Planet kind of thing.<br /> <br /> ...Actually, I might transplant that to the Plot Thread...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 09-20-2016, 01:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T11:29:40-07:00","id":973253,"title":"","content":"Ephemeral Abattoir (Solitary Confinement + Ephemeral Cover)- Inspired by one of the sample &quot;fusion Exploits&quot; from the Storyteller Guide, it pulls a specific type of Ephemeral in contact or colocation with it into a extradimensional space filled with MURDER.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T12:31:58-07:00","id":973295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=973177#post973177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hmmm...I wouldn't think you'd need more than Memory Theft and Hellhounds, but maybe Ephemeral Cover?</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel like near-fielding Urban Legend could accomplish a fair bit of this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T13:48:51-07:00","id":973361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=973295#post973295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I feel like near-fielding Urban Legend could accomplish a fair bit of this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just Urban Legend, or as a component in the above Lambda?<br /> <hr /><br /> <b>Paranoia Engine</b> (Memory Theft + Everybody Knows + Urban Legend): Extracts someone's paranoid delusions to manifest in the physical world. For best results, use on someone with pre-existing paranoid delusions. Do not use on individuals under 5 years in age.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 09-20-2016, 04:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T13:59:59-07:00","id":973373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=973361#post973361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just Urban Legend, or as a component in the above Lambda?</div> </div> </div> </div>Lambda with Heart's Desire or Sum of All Fears or Partitioned Memory, depending on the particular tenor of subject, in all probability.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T11:30:21-07:00","id":974556,"title":"","content":"How's this?<br /> <br /> Everybody Knows + Authority = Contagious Protest Sign. It appears as a rusted square of metal welded to an iron rod. A demand has been painted onto its face. A Kirlian lens reveals built-in circuitry. When used to champion a cause written onto its face, this sign convinces all observers that the protest is both factually accurate and something that they should join in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12243-dreaming-cat","name":"Dreaming Cat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T11:42:08-07:00","id":1074768,"title":"","content":"Some ideas I had regarding Form Lambdas for <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/786694-homebrew-demon-merits?p=847701#post847701\">Evolved Form</a>:<br /> <br /> <b>Black-hole Eruptor</b> (Eliminator Cannon + Newton's Nightmares + Ripple): Instead of firing explosives, this weapon now launches a charge that temporarily creates a localized zone of intense gravity - a miniature singularity. Anything within double the normal blast radius is sucked towards the epicenter, taking damage as they are ripped apart by the gravational forces. The singularity dissipates at the end of the Turn following the one it detonated.<br /> <br /> <b>Blade-Eater Hide</b> (Armored Plates + Disintegrate + Break To Heal): Whenever an inanimate object is blocked by the armor (has any of its damage reduced), it crumbles to dust, healing its Structure in Lethal or Bashing damage on the wearer. Smaller objects like bullets usually can be treated as Structure 1.<br /> <br /> <b>Song of Death</b> (Voice of the Angel + Ultimatum + Ripple): This lets out a dreadful keening - those who hear it and cannot resist must listen to the wail or be turned to dust. Yes, being struck deaf by the initial blast counts as &quot;no longer listening&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-22T15:40:32-07:00","id":1143060,"title":"","content":"Some more Form Lambdas:<br /> <br /> <b>Revenant Protocol (Form Lambda, <u>Resistors</u> + <u>Play Possum</u> + <u>Animate</u>)</b>: The Demon enters a death-like state upon the next attack, seemingly slain by the assault... only to rise in undead fury. After activation, the Demon takes no actual damage but appears dead, yet animated by their own power. Only complete destruction of their body will kill the Demon, and at the end of the combat Scene, they are restored as if no damage taken during it occurred.<br /> <br /> <b>\u200bEye of Sauron (Form Lambda, <u>Clairvoyant Sight</u> + <u>The Look</u>):</b> You can look in on and paralyze any target you know from anywhere.<br /> <b>Balar's Gaze (above + <u>Hellfire</u>)</b>: Upon your choosing, any target you know can spontaneously burst into flames and ash.<br /> <br /> <b>Digital Summoner (Form Lambda, <u>Data Form</u> + <u>Summon</u>):</b> As long as the target is near any kind of signal, the Demon can pull them through the Internet to their location instantly.<br /> <i>&quot;By Bell and Datagram, I command thee! In the name of Turing and Marconi, I compel thee! Appear before me Greg J. Walscott of FedEx, and bring me what is mine!&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 09-22-2017, 07:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}